      "title": "Auditor General: most 2024 projects finished, but funds left idle",
      "text": "The Auditor General's report on the 2024 CDF found 3,060 of 4,879 projects completed and 526 not started, about K771 million unspent out of K5.12 billion available, and only about 17% of CDF loans due collected (K63.8 million of K375.3 million)."
